{
  "_id": "tg-mighty",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Nimrod: he began to be a mighty one, Gen. 10:8. Abraham … become a great and mighty nation, Gen. 18:18. children of Israel are more and mightier than we, Ex. 1:9. king … will not let you go, no, not by a mighty hand, Ex. 3:19. not respect the … poor, nor honour the person of the mighty, Lev. 19:15. make of thee a greater nation and mightier than they, Num. 14:12. God … take him a nation … by a mighty hand, Deut. 4:34. who shall deliver us out of the hand of these mighty Gods, 1 Sam. 4:8. how are the mighty fallen, 2 Sam. 1:19. These be the names of the mighty men whom David had, 2 Sam. 23:8. How he … vowed unto the mighty God of Jacob, Ps. 132:2. their redeemer is mighty, Prov. 23:11. Lord of hosts, the mighty One of Israel, Isa. 1:24. the mighty man shall be humbled, Isa. 5:15 (2 Ne. 15:15). his name shall be called … The mighty God, Isa. 9:6 (2 Ne. 19:6). Lord hath a mighty and strong one, Isa. 28:2. goeth with a pipe … to the mighty One of Israel, Isa. 30:29. with a mighty hand … will I rule over you, Ezek. 20:33.",
