    {
      "text": "the Lord … is mightier than all the earth, 1 Ne. 4:1. I, the Lord, am thy Savior … the Mighty One of Jacob, 1 Ne. 21:26. Lord God will raise up a mighty nation, 1 Ne. 22:7. Lord is their Savior … the Mighty One of Israel, 1 Ne. 22:12. there shall rise up one mighty among them, 2 Ne. 3:24. relying wholly upon the merits of him who is mighty to save, 2 Ne. 31:19 (Alma 34:18; D&C 133:47). Spirit … has wrought a mighty change in us, Mosiah 5:2. Have ye experienced this mighty change in your hearts, Alma 5:14. I will make thee mighty in word and in deed, Hel. 10:5. many mighty miracles wrought by the hands of the apostles, Morm. 9:18. valley was Nimrod, being called after the mighty hunter, Ether 2:1.",
